<title>UK: St George Bank sets $500 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>St George Bank sets $500 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Barclays de Zoete Wedd and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ST GEORGE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +1/16     PAY DATE    20.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A3	  ISS PRICE  99.708    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.708</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7.5 BP    SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
